Subject: Cantor EVO-X2 Scratch Build Executor P0 Harness Design

@ [design_uuid] 2b91ba65-0f40-4cc9-9443-921e98354d47
@ [canonical_uuid] 935e020f-8c6f-49e4-b355-63eabd3b778b
@ [package_core_bookend] f87734eab7b93f7ccb2370667cbb88089d72201d

& [ExecutionBoundary]
  + one fixed PowerShell harness coordinates package and commission verification preflight seven ordered operations receipt verification and conservation without evaluating a command string
  + executor operations1 2 and7 and Cargo operations3 through6 enter one shared safe-Rust contract and the pre-existing audited Windows job-object containment island
  + each contained process begins suspended is assigned before resume inherits only an explicit bounded environment closes stdin drains both streams concurrently and terminates the job on timeout output overflow or residue
  + output overflow is a reportable failed operation with a bounded retained prefix digest and truncation mark rather than an unaccounted infrastructure exception

& [Toolchain]
  + an explicit contained cargo metadata --locked --offline --format-version 1 probe follows exact source materialization and precedes every Cargo gate
  + Cargo rustc and linker are existing C-drive ordinary-file observations with path byte digest and file version evidence; no install download PATH mutation or dependency source is admitted
  + only the fixed Cargo environment plus an allowlisted Windows platform environment reaches child processes; ambient Rust flags wrappers profile and target overrides never pass the contract

& [Evidence]
  + the operation runner writes create-new bounded stdout stderr and unsealed operation records beneath the exact target and proves a target-byte fixed point after each operation
  + the fixed executor seals stopped candidates provider-free from exact canonical stdin and seals a successful receipt as operation7 from the exact target
  + package preflight and postflight verification protected roots provider identity and zero persistent service processes bind the receipt and the retained detailed audits

& [Construction]
  + the local package builder accepts one published lower-hex implementation commit and its explicit published immediate single-parent bookend verifies local and fetched equality at the bookend archives every package input from the exact implementation and builds seven release binaries locked offline serialized on D:/
  + the remote package contains exactly21 implementation artifacts plus implementation_manifest.json commission.json and deployment_envelope.json for24 files total
  + the pinned experiment source archive remains commit4fdd29cb7e76ddd827bcc7ceb8ca36ab28864271 SHA256 162a82f42619249a11a81ce64c29889eb5cd448a2d3d864ccb5bf26f1b0f325d and is not replaced by the implementation archive

& [FailureSemantics]
  + nonzero timeout overflow or other recorded child failure stops every later operation and seals failed physical_build_performed false evidence
  + pre-operation infrastructure or toolchain refusal seals refused physical_build_performed false evidence from only completed successful operation records when protected and provider conservation remains observable
  + conservation drift prevents a valid receipt and leaves all prior evidence and scratch state untouched for review
  + no automatic cleanup retry repair online fallback Git mutation provider call model inference service change persistence self-update or recurring execution exists

& [Authority]
  + this design authorizes provider-free host-free implementation fixtures and complete-package construction on D:/ only after the package-core bookend
  - never: contact EVO-X2 transfer install observe its toolchain create C:/AI scratch roots or execute the live package before this harness package evidence is verified published and immediately bookended
